        ("Udhampur · Kud","The NH44 climbs past Udhampur towards Kud, known for its kalakand and patisa sweets — the usual tea stop on the way to Patnitop."),
        ("Patnitop · Sanasar","About 110 km, roughly 3 hours. Patnitop sits at about 2,020 m on the old Jammu–Srinagar road, which the Chenani–Nashri tunnel now bypasses, so the town is quieter. Sanasar meadow and Natha Top are short drives further on."),
        ("Shiv Khori","About 140 km via Katra and Reasi. Cars stop at the Ransoo base camp; from there the cave of Shiv Khori is a walk of about 3 km on the shrine board's track. A long day from Jammu, easier from Katra."),
        ("Srinagar","About 250 km on NH44 through the Chenani–Nashri and Banihal tunnels, 6–8 hours. Drop at your houseboat ghat or hotel; see our <a href=\"/cabs/jammu-to-srinagar-taxi/\">Jammu to Srinagar taxi</a>."),
