       ("What is the Jammu to Katra taxi fare?",f"A one-way drop to Katra (about 45–50 km, 1–1.5 hours) starts around {_S(48,1.0)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',48,1.0)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',48,1.0)} in an Innova Crysta. If you want the same car to wait in Katra and bring you back the next day, the 2-day rate of {_DAY('sedan',2)} in a sedan works out better."),
       ("What is the Jammu airport to Katra taxi fare?",f"The same as from the city: from {_S(48,1.0)} in a sedan and {_O('crysta',48,1.0)} in an Innova Crysta, one-way. The driver tracks your flight, meets you at arrivals and drops you at your Katra hotel or the yatra registration counter."),
       ("What is the Jammu to Patnitop taxi fare?",f"Patnitop is about 110 km (around 3 hours). A one-way drop starts around {_S(110,1.1)} in a sedan and {_O('crysta',110,1.1)} in an Innova Crysta; a same-day return with Sanasar fits in the full-day rate of {_DAY('sedan')} in a sedan."),
       ("How do I go from Jammu to Shiv Khori by taxi?",f"Shiv Khori is about 140 km via Katra and Reasi. Cars go up to the Ransoo base camp, and the cave is a walk of about 3 km from there. A one-way drop starts around {_S(140,1.1)} in a sedan; a same-day return is covered by the full-day rate of {_DAY('sedan')}."),
       ("What is the Jammu to Srinagar taxi fare?",f"One-way starts around {_S(250,1.7)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',250,1.7)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',250,1.7)} in an Innova Crysta for about 250 km (6–8 hours) through the tunnels on NH44. Tolls and parking are extra."),
