       ("What is the Haridwar to Kedarnath taxi fare?",f"Cars go as far as Sonprayag, about 235 km from Haridwar. A one-way drop starts around {_S(235,1.1)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',235,1.1)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',235,1.1)} in an Innova Crysta. From Sonprayag a shuttle runs to Gaurikund, where the trek to Kedarnath begins. Most families book the whole trip as a per-km round tour instead."),
