       ("What is the taxi fare from Haridwar to Delhi?",f"One-way starts around {_S(220,.85)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',220,.85)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',220,.85)} in an Innova Crysta for about 220 km (4.5–5.5 hours). Drops anywhere in Delhi NCR including IGI Airport; tolls are extra at actuals."),
