       ("What is the Dehradun airport to Rishikesh taxi fare?","Jolly Grant airport is about 20 km from Rishikesh, 35–45 minutes by road. The fare depends on the drop point (Tapovan, the Ram Jhula side, AIIMS or a Shivpuri camp) and the car, so we quote it on WhatsApp. The driver tracks your flight and waits at arrivals."),
       ("What is the Rishikesh to Neelkanth taxi fare?",f"Neelkanth Mahadev is about 32 km by road, roughly an hour each way, so it is usually a half-day trip quoted on WhatsApp for your pickup point and car. Add Haridwar or Devprayag on the same day and the full-day rate of {_DAY('sedan')} in a sedan (up to 250 km) is better value."),
       ("What is the taxi fare from Rishikesh to Delhi?",f"One-way starts around {_S(240,.85)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',240,.85)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',240,.85)} in an Innova Crysta for about 240 km (5–6 hours). Drops anywhere in Delhi NCR including IGI Airport; tolls are extra at actuals."),
