       ("What is the Rishikesh to Badrinath taxi fare?",f"A one-way drop to Badrinath (about 295 km via Devprayag, Karnaprayag and Joshimath) starts around {_S(295,1.1)} in a sedan and {_O('crysta',295,1.1)} in an Innova Crysta. A Badrinath round trip is billed per kilometre with a 250 km daily minimum plus ₹400 a night driver allowance."),
