       ("What is the Chandigarh airport to Manali taxi fare?",f"One-way starts around {_S(290,0.95)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',290,0.95)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',290,0.95)} in an Innova Crysta. The drive is about 290–300 km and 7–8 hours via Kiratpur, Mandi and Kullu, so plan a morning arrival."),
       ("How far is Chandigarh airport from the city?","The airport is at Jhiurheri on the Mohali side, about 12 km (20–30 minutes) from Sector 17, about 8 km from Mohali and about 14 km from Chandigarh railway station. Short Tricity transfers are quoted on WhatsApp; the airport also has a prepaid taxi counter and app-cab pickup outside arrivals."),
       ("Where will the driver meet me at Chandigarh airport?","At the arrivals exit of the terminal, holding a card with your name. You get the driver's name, phone and car number on WhatsApp before you land, and he tracks your flight."),
       ("What is the taxi fare from Chandigarh to Delhi airport (IGI)?",f"One-way starts around {_S(250,.85)} in a sedan, {_O('ertiga',250,.85)} in an Ertiga and {_O('crysta',250,.85)} in an Innova Crysta, about 4.5–5 hours. We pick up from IXC or anywhere in the Tricity; keep extra time for traffic before an international flight. The same car works the other way, from IGI to Chandigarh."),
       ("How much is a taxi from Chandigarh airport to Kasauli?",f"Kasauli is about 65 km, around 2 hours via Pinjore and Parwanoo. One-way starts at {_S(65,1.1)} in a sedan; for a same-day return the full-day rate of {_DAY('sedan')} (up to 250 km) is better value."),
